    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d433">

                <pb facs="0576" n="534" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg534"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-03-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 30, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I duly received your note of the 23d
                    instant, on the subject of an alleged disregard by the United States attorney at
                    Key West of the wishes of this government with reference to the mails of
                    friendly powers found on board of captured vessels.</p>
                <p>In reply, I have the honor to acquaint you that proper instructions upon the
                    subject have been given to that officer.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be your very obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
